WEBVTT

00:13.310 --> 00:14.130
Huh?

00:17.260 --> 00:19.120
Am I... in water?

00:25.220 --> 00:26.630
What are these lights?

00:32.260 --> 00:33.620
A giant fish?!

00:35.790 --> 00:37.640
No... a dragon!

00:37.640 --> 00:39.160
 Sera....

00:39.160 --> 00:43.140
I am glad I chose you.

00:43.570 --> 00:44.460
What?

00:52.250 --> 00:54.350
Wait! What do you mean by—

00:59.110 --> 01:00.200
It was a dream?

01:01.980 --> 01:03.190
But why...?

01:03.880 --> 01:05.850
How could a dragon talk?

01:05.850 --> 01:08.840
And such a massive creature...

01:09.020 --> 01:11.370
I've never seen or heard 
of anything like it.

01:11.370 --> 01:14.730
Did the Morisuberi we hunted show 
up in my dreams, or something?

01:14.730 --> 01:16.720
Get off...

01:16.720 --> 01:19.970
Illdoren, you're gonna 
squeeze my guts out...

01:21.210 --> 01:23.160
L-Lady Vyufmec?!

01:40.910 --> 01:48.550
The Warrior Princess and the Barbaric King

03:03.280 --> 03:05.970
There are elves and dwarves 
from out of a fairy tale,

03:05.970 --> 03:08.660
along with some 
menacing-looking living plants...

03:11.660 --> 03:13.130
You are so obnoxious.

03:13.460 --> 03:17.130
Wh-Why am I being forced to deal with 
barbarians and inhuman creatures?!

03:17.520 --> 03:21.130
I already told you; today we're 
performing the great cleansing ritual.

03:21.810 --> 03:26.350
Which is why the five tribes have 
gathered so early in the morning.

03:26.350 --> 03:31.570
E-Even, so, how do you expect me to accept 
something so egregiously fantastical?!

03:32.450 --> 03:37.050
Y'know, in the short time I've known 
you, it's clear how fanatical you are...

03:37.050 --> 03:40.470
But do you really think that the 
only things that exist in this world

03:40.470 --> 03:42.530
are the things that you 
personally find believable?

03:43.910 --> 03:46.260
Hey, the gang's all here.

03:46.260 --> 03:48.290
Saint Wysteresia!

03:48.670 --> 03:51.910
You're responsible for 
the blight, this time.

03:52.690 --> 03:56.310
So you're going to participate in our 
tradition of the great cleansing.

03:56.310 --> 03:57.790
B-But...

03:57.790 --> 03:59.550
Cleansed though you may be,

03:59.880 --> 04:04.930
it's important you personally 
see the results of your actions.

04:05.360 --> 04:06.930
Cleansed?

04:07.660 --> 04:09.740
She doesn't even realize it...

04:09.740 --> 04:11.730
Say that again, elf?!

04:11.730 --> 04:14.730
What name did your parents give you?

04:15.660 --> 04:18.100
You want my name?! What for?!

04:18.100 --> 04:19.570
Let's just hear it.

04:19.570 --> 04:23.930
Well, I got the surname 
of Malcius from the abbot,

04:23.930 --> 04:28.020
seven years ago when I 
became a retinue priest...

04:28.460 --> 04:29.490
Wait.

04:29.810 --> 04:33.250
What did they call me at 
the orphanage again...?

04:33.250 --> 04:36.750
I know that becoming a retinue 
priest at 16 was unprecedented...

04:36.750 --> 04:41.260
But prior to that? Sixteen years...

04:41.260 --> 04:43.200
You don't remember any of it?!

04:43.200 --> 04:45.490
And 16 years would be 
the majority of your life!

04:45.490 --> 04:47.090
Th-That can't be right!

04:48.290 --> 04:52.880
I can remember six years 
ago... seven years ago...

04:52.880 --> 04:58.770
Eight years ago... nothing? 
Nothing, nothing, nothing?!

04:58.770 --> 05:00.820
Whoa, Malcius!

05:00.820 --> 05:02.410
It's an effect of the blight.

05:03.420 --> 05:07.690
It's honestly a miracle she 
survived in the first place.

05:07.690 --> 05:12.690
True. You could say that losing 
her memories is a small price.

05:12.690 --> 05:15.330
Though I doubt she'd agree.

05:16.600 --> 05:18.540
This might be insensitive,

05:18.540 --> 05:21.300
but maybe forgetting about the 
memories of being a slave to religion

05:21.300 --> 05:23.340
would be better for her...

05:22.770 --> 05:23.650
Wha?!

05:24.450 --> 05:27.580
Wh-Wh-What did you just say?

05:27.580 --> 05:31.870
You think I'd be better off forgetting 
my devotion to the Lord?!

05:31.870 --> 05:33.960
H-How dare you?!

05:33.960 --> 05:36.410
Then try and remember something.

05:36.410 --> 05:40.560
Assuming there were any thoughts 
in your head to remember.

05:40.830 --> 05:46.320
Y-Y-You just keep running 
your mouth, you little wench!

05:46.570 --> 05:49.910
I only stated the truth, 
you freckled four-eyes!

05:49.910 --> 05:53.700
My a-a-appearance has nothing 
to do with my religion!

05:53.970 --> 05:57.460
They met a few days ago and 
look how they get along...

05:57.460 --> 06:00.220
Hard to say if they're compatible, or not.

06:00.220 --> 06:01.960
Shouldn't we do something?

06:01.960 --> 06:05.210
I doubt it'll escalate 
into anything dangerous.

06:06.670 --> 06:08.720
And if it does, I'll stop them.

06:08.720 --> 06:10.510
Yeah, fight, fight!

06:12.180 --> 06:15.430
You start a fight, and are 
already on the ground?

06:15.430 --> 06:20.230
You were the one who was 
mocking me, barbarian girl!

06:24.520 --> 06:27.570
Don't take a retinue priest with the 
E-E-Eastern Expedition forces lightly!

06:27.570 --> 06:30.530
All that marching has made me fit!

06:30.530 --> 06:32.620
Ow! Ow!

06:32.620 --> 06:35.750
You might've been able 
to get the drop on me,

06:35.750 --> 06:38.900
but if you really think I'm 
better off without my memories,

06:38.900 --> 06:40.620
then how about this, little barbarian?

06:41.100 --> 06:44.750
I might hate what the 
Order of Commoneras stands for,

06:45.060 --> 06:47.760
but I did receive some 
charity from them once...

06:49.380 --> 06:51.950
I forgot to mention this earlier,

06:51.950 --> 06:56.520
but did you know that this 
barbarian-styled girl is actually—

07:03.990 --> 07:05.020
She's got her.

07:06.010 --> 07:10.780
Bar...bar...ian...

07:15.010 --> 07:17.040
We have a winner!

07:17.040 --> 07:19.820
I suppose I'll carry Malcius...

07:21.090 --> 07:24.650
Why don't the three of you 
run down to the river, then?

07:25.270 --> 07:28.450
There's still time before 
the great cleansing.

07:28.450 --> 07:31.780
It'll be a good chance to get in 
the water and clean up a little.

07:31.780 --> 07:36.430
A good suggestion. A wash before 
the ritual would do you well.

07:36.430 --> 07:37.990
B-But...

07:37.990 --> 07:40.930
The preparations will go
 just fine without you three.

07:41.550 --> 07:43.810
I mean, it's not like 
you have anything to do.

07:45.700 --> 07:47.170
Don't feel bad!

07:47.170 --> 07:51.930
I'm going to spend the ritual relaxing 
at my nephew's house, anyway.

07:51.930 --> 07:53.290
I'm too old for this shit!

07:53.290 --> 07:54.780
Resia...

07:54.780 --> 07:58.330
You heard her, Cersei. 
See them to the river.

07:58.940 --> 08:00.080
Right.

08:02.330 --> 08:06.630
I'm sure you noticed, 
from what this fanatic nearly said...

08:07.340 --> 08:10.370
And it's true. I am from Illdoren.

08:10.370 --> 08:13.840
I was part of the Eastern 
Cultivation Corps, six years ago.

08:14.530 --> 08:16.040
I thought as much.

08:16.040 --> 08:19.380
Your disdain for nobles, and the fact that

08:19.380 --> 08:23.270
you called me a knight instead of 
a warrior had caught my notice.

08:23.870 --> 08:27.880
That said, I'd imagine learning 
how to help equip armor

08:27.880 --> 08:30.610
didn't come from being in 
the Cultivation Corp...

08:30.880 --> 08:36.320
I'd ask you not to pry any further. 
That country isn't my home anymore.

08:36.320 --> 08:40.490
I am Cersei, Master Veor's attendant, 
and these lands are where I belong.

08:41.450 --> 08:45.450
I treat you as the woman my 
master has chosen to court.

08:45.450 --> 08:48.500
So please, do not start treating 
me as a citizen of Illdoren.

08:50.190 --> 08:51.510
I would never...

08:52.340 --> 08:55.620
Well, you may have a point. 
I'll be more careful.

08:58.120 --> 08:59.150
Cersei...

08:59.150 --> 09:00.010
Yes?

09:00.540 --> 09:06.520
Are the memories of our homeland... 
something you would rather forget?

09:11.560 --> 09:17.280
Well... it's more like I don't remember, 
anyway. And can't be bothered to.

09:18.300 --> 09:21.180
Since I never intend on going back.

09:24.290 --> 09:28.040
H-How could I, a retinue priest, 
be so careless?!

09:28.040 --> 09:30.020
I understand how you feel,

09:30.020 --> 09:33.370
but you would've been stuck like 
that unless someone said something.

09:34.050 --> 09:37.150
While it's true that my 
memories might be... hazy...

09:37.150 --> 09:40.550
It looked like you'd mutter
 to yourself for the rest of your life.

09:40.550 --> 09:42.310
S-S-Say what?!

09:43.510 --> 09:45.560
Just calm down, Malcius.

09:45.560 --> 09:48.650
Could someone explain why 
I'm on an errand

09:48.650 --> 09:50.910
with the girl I was wrestling with?!

09:50.910 --> 09:53.940
I might be willing to accompany 
this barbarian girl

09:53.940 --> 09:57.790
since I can't leave your side, 
Lady Serafina, but...

09:57.790 --> 09:59.480
Because you stink.

10:00.200 --> 10:02.870
What did you just say?

10:03.720 --> 10:06.620
Are you saying I s-s-stink?

10:07.260 --> 10:09.750
Yes, you do.

10:09.750 --> 10:12.170
I'm sure you haven't noticed yourself,

10:12.170 --> 10:15.840
but it's a mixture of blood, sweat,
a bit sour, and some faint perfume.

10:16.910 --> 10:19.960
I have to wonder how long
it's been since you last bathed.

10:21.090 --> 10:22.830
Uh...

10:23.250 --> 10:27.720
Well, it was four days before 
Lady Serafina served as the vanguard,

10:27.720 --> 10:30.600
and was captured the barbarians...

10:34.780 --> 10:36.620
Over half a month?

10:40.250 --> 10:43.140
Malcius... it's just... well...

10:43.480 --> 10:44.970
There was never a good time...

10:44.970 --> 10:47.620
and I do feel bad for 
not saying anything.

10:48.120 --> 10:48.930
Forgive me.

10:49.580 --> 10:50.620
Right.

10:53.450 --> 10:58.100
That said, I've worked up quite a 
sweat over these last two or three days.

10:58.990 --> 11:01.220
This might be perfect timing.

11:02.050 --> 11:05.340
I'll keep my sword nearby, 
just in case we need it.

11:05.340 --> 11:08.140
I really doubt you need to worry about it.

11:13.540 --> 11:17.860
This area around the mountain by the 
village is Master Veor's territory,

11:18.130 --> 11:20.260
so dragons don't come around here often.

11:20.260 --> 11:24.000
E-Even if they're rare, you still bathe 
in places dragons have been seen?

11:24.000 --> 11:27.290
Well, anywhere else would 
be actual dragon territory,

11:27.290 --> 11:30.370
as I'm sure you saw in the western woods.

11:31.210 --> 11:33.230
I want to go back west...

11:33.230 --> 11:35.130
I'm sorry, Malcius.

11:38.540 --> 11:44.280
But like I told you before, I don't 
intend on leaving here any time soon.

11:46.690 --> 11:51.250
I'd recommend cleaning up quickly. 
You don't want to catch a chill.

11:53.210 --> 11:54.030
Right.

11:58.120 --> 11:59.590
Lady Serafina?

12:10.710 --> 12:13.710
A campfire after a bath can be quite nice.

12:14.660 --> 12:19.210
Cleaning off does lose its charm 
if you're freezing from the water.

12:20.230 --> 12:21.740
It's warm...

12:23.430 --> 12:25.710
I think they're just about done.

12:27.070 --> 12:29.470
Yes, it looks like it.

12:37.700 --> 12:38.990
It's good...

12:47.490 --> 12:51.110
I suppose it's time for 
this great cleansing...

12:53.450 --> 12:57.470
Gotta say, it's real good the blight 
was purged as fast as it was.

12:57.470 --> 12:59.020
If it's still in its cocoon,

12:59.020 --> 13:01.900
the cleansing is easier to set up, 
and easier to do!

13:01.900 --> 13:04.280
I heard the new bride took it down.

13:04.280 --> 13:06.640
Talk about bold. Couldn't be me!

13:07.220 --> 13:10.510
I can't believe how much the 
story has spread in one day...

13:10.510 --> 13:14.010
Oh, we worked hard to make 
it happen, believe me!

13:14.980 --> 13:21.260
Come to think of it, Malcius landed 
on your head, knocking you both out...

13:21.260 --> 13:25.280
I-I'm not usually that careless! 
I didn't have a helmet, either!

13:25.770 --> 13:28.820
Besides, I dare you to find 
anyone who doesn't relax

13:28.820 --> 13:30.280
after slaying something like that!

13:31.930 --> 13:34.030
I suppose you're right about that.

13:34.030 --> 13:39.930
And while Illdoren was knocked 
out, we were flying all around!

13:39.930 --> 13:41.260
And now, I'm exhausted!

13:41.260 --> 13:45.010
That sounds like quite the ordeal. 
Thank you for your efforts.

13:45.250 --> 13:48.350
Well, the truth is, I don't 
really know what exhaustion is.

13:48.930 --> 13:53.060
You see, Sera, because the Tefyu 
are more like natural phenomenon,

13:53.060 --> 13:54.930
their perception is bit 
different from ours.

13:55.280 --> 13:59.520
She might even have trouble 
telling Cersei and Malcius apart.

13:59.520 --> 14:02.940
That seems like more than "a bit."

14:03.790 --> 14:04.570
What's it matter,

14:04.570 --> 14:07.330
as long as I can tell the difference 
between important people?

14:07.330 --> 14:10.310
That's starting to sound 
more like disinterest...

14:12.280 --> 14:13.700
Here we are!

14:15.900 --> 14:17.240
There it is.

14:17.240 --> 14:19.830
What a mess...

14:36.510 --> 14:38.350
What is this?

14:38.600 --> 14:41.670
Wh-Wh-What the? 
It's like it's been bleached...

14:50.490 --> 14:53.350
This is... white dust?

14:55.270 --> 14:59.400
The area where we fought the 
Fiend has turned to dust.

15:00.180 --> 15:02.330
Another effect of the blight.

15:02.880 --> 15:05.470
The same way that we all have wills,

15:05.470 --> 15:09.020
the earth, water, flame, 
and wind do as well.

15:09.470 --> 15:12.030
And while they're all similiar in nature,

15:12.030 --> 15:15.180
there's one fundamental difference between

15:15.180 --> 15:18.020
the will of living creatures 
and any other kind....

15:18.690 --> 15:23.260
When a life is depleted of willpower, 
it simply never returns.

15:23.260 --> 15:27.740
But for for everything else... 
for nature itself, willpower stagnates,

15:27.740 --> 15:30.550
grows corrupt, forgetting its 
intended state, and turns to dust.

15:31.780 --> 15:34.730
Or so I was told
by our resident Rijutsushi,

15:34.730 --> 15:36.870
Karka Roth, several years ago.

15:36.870 --> 15:37.550
Hello!

15:38.340 --> 15:42.460
It sounded really convincing...
but it was all just second-hand knowledge?

15:38.990 --> 15:40.500
Hey there!

15:42.850 --> 15:46.510
I suppose I can go into 
greater detail, then.

15:46.510 --> 15:52.880
But first, I'd like to see the tool 
of the fool who caused this mess.

15:56.390 --> 15:57.010
Here it is.

15:58.830 --> 16:01.730
Th-That's my scripture!

16:01.730 --> 16:02.690
Give it back!

16:02.690 --> 16:04.600
Thief...!

16:06.610 --> 16:10.180
A rijutsu text, primarily focused 
on converting things to light,

16:10.180 --> 16:11.610
heat, and impact.

16:11.930 --> 16:13.670
I thought as much.

16:13.670 --> 16:16.490
Indeed. Completely lacking in artistry.

16:16.490 --> 16:20.880
B-But it seemed dangerous 
enough to do real damage

16:20.880 --> 16:23.500
if one wasn't wearing armor...

16:23.500 --> 16:28.030
It used enough of the land's willpower 
to leave it in this state, after all.

16:28.030 --> 16:30.670
There's no arguing against its potency.

16:30.670 --> 16:32.180
But from our point of view,

16:32.180 --> 16:37.260
the very idea of using rijutsu for 
destruction is inherently crude.

16:39.160 --> 16:45.210
Now, then, it's almost noon. 
With weather this pleasant,

16:45.210 --> 16:47.400
it should prove a nice 
wake-up call, for the land.

16:54.890 --> 16:56.070
What are those?

16:56.070 --> 16:59.660
Catalysts. Brought in by 
the different clans...

16:59.660 --> 17:03.540
Offering earth, water, 
fire, and wind catalysts

17:03.540 --> 17:05.420
along with a prayer acts as an excitation

17:05.940 --> 17:09.170
to help the land recall its true nature.

17:24.060 --> 17:25.500
Let's begin.

17:39.270 --> 17:43.450
In the name of the great spirits, we will
now perform the great cleansing.

17:45.930 --> 17:49.880
Vesenem kehfem kehnakyahne fonehda.

17:50.810 --> 17:56.620
Something about his words sounded older 
than any language I'd ever heard,

17:57.110 --> 17:59.820
as they echoed across the depleted earth.

18:01.130 --> 18:06.480
Sesah mufeneh enim oyavee eewoo.

18:06.830 --> 18:12.730
A call for purification, 
passed down for countless millennia.

18:15.890 --> 18:20.310
Vanoh oo oah vanokeh

18:20.830 --> 18:25.070
effzoh keffay wekiyoh!

18:25.070 --> 18:28.140
Chasing away calamity, purging blight...

18:28.140 --> 18:32.750
A prayer to purify 
all wickedness in creation.

18:36.740 --> 18:38.570
A call for a great cleansing...

19:13.930 --> 19:15.420
That should do.

19:17.710 --> 19:20.200
What did you think, Sera?

19:24.840 --> 19:25.850
Sera...?

19:30.670 --> 19:32.460
Why are you crying?

19:40.820 --> 19:42.790
That makes 30.

19:52.660 --> 19:57.640
The idea of a Lavillant woman planting 
trees would've been unheard of.

19:58.820 --> 20:00.340
But it's not bad.

20:00.830 --> 20:03.600
That said, I wasn't expecting 
such a mystic ritual to be

20:03.600 --> 20:06.230
followed by this kind of group work.

20:06.850 --> 20:09.530
You look puzzled.

20:10.020 --> 20:14.820
Veor? Well, I was just thinking 
about how ordinary this all seems.

20:14.820 --> 20:19.480
You're right. Healing a 
forest takes ordinary work.

20:19.480 --> 20:24.500
But if we don't attend to this ordinary 
work, then the forest will be lost.

20:24.830 --> 20:26.140
Which will cause trouble

20:26.140 --> 20:28.550
for our children, grandchildren, 
and future generations.

20:29.240 --> 20:32.750
The sentiment that only 
our individual concerns,

20:32.750 --> 20:36.450
in the present, are what matter...

20:36.450 --> 20:39.930
Is a rejection of our shared fate 
is what gives rise to the blight.

20:41.260 --> 20:44.760
Fiends are the avatars of 
greed and self-interest.

20:45.610 --> 20:49.760
In this current case, the willpower of 
the land was being drained for the spell,

20:49.760 --> 20:52.020
and after having become unstable,

20:52.230 --> 20:57.900
the land, in return, drained the 
caster of their memories and will.

20:57.900 --> 21:02.450
It takes all that in return? 
That sounds severe.

21:02.790 --> 21:04.400
It certainly is.

21:04.400 --> 21:08.910
Severe enough to wipe the memory and 
personality of the one involved.

21:08.910 --> 21:13.080
Then Malcius' memories being lost...

21:13.080 --> 21:15.500
Yes, that was the cause.

21:15.500 --> 21:16.920
I mentioned a bit about this earlier,

21:17.270 --> 21:19.750
but this would normally be enough 
to leave someone a shell...

21:19.750 --> 21:21.470
Rarely is someone
 lucky enough to be freed

21:21.470 --> 21:23.550
before they are fully drained.

21:23.550 --> 21:27.930
Such individuals are typically 
said to have been cleansed.

21:31.390 --> 21:32.790
Barbarian girl...

21:34.890 --> 21:36.230
Your said your name was Malcius.

21:39.830 --> 21:42.040
That's the name given to children 
raised in the orphanage

21:42.040 --> 21:46.420
attached to the 
Order of Commoneras' Malcius Abbey.

21:48.650 --> 21:51.500
I honestly think you're better 
off forgetting what would've

21:51.500 --> 21:53.230
led you to being taken in

21:53.230 --> 21:56.100
by that country's orphanage 
and what you went through there.

21:56.910 --> 22:00.830
You should focus on 
planting those saplings.

22:02.130 --> 22:04.170
That's another kind of cleansing.

22:12.140 --> 22:14.810
Translation: Lee Francis

Timing: Andy Ellis

Editing: Zachary Carlysle

Quality Control: Salem Alabanza

Translation Check: Sho Stifler

22:18.510 --> 22:20.110
Say, Veor...

22:20.970 --> 22:27.290
I think I know why you all consider 
the blight so wretched, now.

22:28.130 --> 22:29.470
I see.

22:29.470 --> 22:30.620
And...

22:31.740 --> 22:36.200
The east... the relationship between 
the people here, and nature...

22:36.730 --> 22:41.210
I think I understand what you're fighting,
and trying to accomplish, too.

22:46.650 --> 22:47.830
I see.
